{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_155_title", "source_sha256": "bb51aa23498bd995309f02a31c80a6dde0f827ed16f74daeda2e04ad06360936", "ja": "ヒカリを見つけて", "zh": "寻得光芒", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_155_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4553f8c3296212e05fd1c3c9e31ed4e3bee44a5ea22a33159c8984c7f9d57759", "ja": "ドラマの主要キャストに抜擢される琴葉。\n共演者に「アイドル枠」「純粋に芝居を見て\nほしければ俳優になればいい」と言われ戸惑\nうが、プロデューサーの言葉で、自分の意思\nでアイドルを続けている事を再確認する。", "zh": "琴叶被选拔为电视剧的主要演员。\n同台演员对她说“偶像名额”“要是想让别人纯粹看你的演技，去当演员不就好了”，让她陷入了迷茫，但在制作人的话语鼓励下，她再次坚定了自己是凭自己的意志在继续做偶像的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_155_1000_null", "source_sha256": "cbf1c3d388e8b8f9365274b96b2f307191d8e8fa8e4ebee23914a263edea97aa", "ja": "数週間後、ドラマ撮影本番……", "zh": "数周后，电视剧正式开拍……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_155_1001_hiyama", "source_sha256": "2162b7a747401b4d95a15a818e0628f4d29116a7cc158b8e4385dbd1e49bb889", "ja": "「洋服のデザイナーになりたい……？\nだって貴方、今までそんな事、一言も……」", "zh": "“想成为服装设计师……？\n可你以前，明明从没提过这种事……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_155_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "a3f5c92c01a016397693f16b59ed4875cd98a05492033e9f293166975af0e55e", "ja": "「ごめんなさい。お母さんが、私に跡を継いで\nほしいって思ってるの、知ってたから」", "zh": "「对不起。因为我知道，妈妈一直希望\n由我来继承家业」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_155_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "44d619173c4e99f39849a878e7df63c1a37d3c5f5520225950f13326e4c97c77", "ja": "「娘だから、とかじゃなくて。ひとりの和裁士として、\n私の実力を認めてもらえて、本当にうれしかった……」", "zh": "「不是因为我是女儿，而是作为一名和裁士，\n我的实力得到了认可，这真的让我好开心……」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_155_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "bd63cf3f3a0da8851edaa0546a7129c20676fa97ae87688aa72ebb4a69a6b864", "ja": "「でも、それじゃダメだって気づいたの。\n今のままの私じゃ、お母さんを超えられないから！」", "zh": "「可是，我发觉这样是不行的。\n因为现在的我，是无法超越母亲的！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_155_1006_kantoku", "source_sha256": "d89f8a1d70a281e8a0f1d45d9db81cda49db1964d6c2e054d0aadf4ab532d606", "ja": "カット！　オッケー！\n田中さん、バッチリです！　その感じで次もお願いね！", "zh": "咔！好，没问题！\n田中小姐，太棒了！下一条也请保持这种感觉哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_155_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "ade8b85970e654e517f0d13b049f8c939d3a6c3203ea43f6a4ac3c859876acef", "ja": "はいっ！\nよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "好！\n请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_155_1008_kyouensya2", "source_sha256": "ccdd983ba7fff4e49b093a34b088788d091bcaa2515fc98b42ad812b44b8c646", "ja": "いやあ、田中さん、稽古のときより\nグンとよくなってたよ。頑張ったね、お疲れ様！", "zh": "哎呀，田中小姐，比排练的时候\n进步太多了。很努力呢，辛苦啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_155_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "b28416779b63e47f548c6fe2b99c46e0aa074abfeaf764cdc7223fe29e897a24", "ja": "ありがとうございます……！\nそれじゃ私、お先に失礼します！", "zh": "谢谢您……！\n那么我先告辞了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_155_1010_hiyama", "source_sha256": "847113cd300a78ccf37d16649d23b6c2d459698bb51362a76be6cfeee5fdfec1", "ja": "……田中さん、ちょっと。", "zh": "……田中同学，过来一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_155_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "be2eb2ce4264d88b01ee2b360e5d7735b6bf68aca7b039440507e706176c230b", "ja": "……？　はい！", "zh": "……？在！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_155_1012_hiyama", "source_sha256": "ccac6e44e419d9855766935f4f10b3a8c949997159a0a7a751c79760d4ca95d0", "ja": "これ。", "zh": "这个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_155_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "c3bbde494e021895527c52ebb82ac91dc684a46aef529da231ab01f67f65a1ad", "ja": "えっ……。\nあの、これは……？", "zh": "咦……。\n那个，这是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_155_1014_hiyama", "source_sha256": "92768e9e23322bf0a248ffe7a910073e31e5e512184e3c94badbfda2cacffbcd", "ja": "私が出る舞台のチケット。", "zh": "我出演的舞台门票。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_155_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "4756ded58b3109775a8fb5fca9f2613a88f2b15b71717048e12e8127d2a46329", "ja": "……！\nそんな……いただいて、いいんですか？", "zh": "……！\n这怎么好意思……我真的可以收下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
